# text = I tell you that the hour is come , when we must rally round one another as One united power , and crumble into dust the oppressors that too long have battened upon the plunder of our families , upon the sweat of our brows , upon the labour of our hands , upon the strength of our sinews , upon the God - created glorious rights of Humanity , and upon the holy and eternal privileges of Brotherhood Good Hear , hear , hear Hurrah But oh , my friends and brothers !
