# text = So , whether I am waiting for a hostile message , or an assignation , or a penitent remonstrance , or an impromptu wrestle with my friend Bounderby in the Lancashire manner - which would seem as likely as anything else in the present state of affairs - I'll dine Bounderby has the advantage in point of weight ; and if anything of a British nature is to come off between us , it may be as well to be in training Some dinner at six - with a beefsteak in it It wouldn't be bad to give the waiter five shillings , and throw him Or a fellow of about thirteen or fourteen stone might be hired by the hour like the Holy Office and slow torture Beg your pardon , sir .
