# text = Never you mind what I took her for ; that's my look out I was merely going on to remark , Bounderby , that we may all be more or less in the wrong , not even excepting you ; and that some yielding on your part , remembering the trust you have accepted , may not only be an act of true kindness , but perhaps a debt incurred towards Louisa I think differently Let me seriously entreat you to reconsider this , Bounderby before you commit yourself to such a decision I always come to a decision and whatever I do , I do at once .
