# text = And now , my friends - my labouring friends , for I rejoice and triumph in that stigma - my friends whose hard but honest beds are made in toil , and whose scanty but independent pots are boiled in hardship ; and now , I say , my friends , what appellation has that dastard craven taken to himself , when , with the mask torn from his features , he stands before us in all his native deformity , a What ?
